# Root-context image inputs (Podman also reads this file).
# Keep unrelated tools, local configuration and generated artifacts out of the context.
**
!vibe-talk/
!vibe-talk/Cargo.toml
!vibe-talk/Cargo.lock
!vibe-talk/build.rs
!vibe-talk/build_page.rs
!vibe-talk/src/**
!vibe-talk/web/**
!vibe-talk/prompts/**
!vibe-talk/syntaxes/**
!vibe-talk/contract/
!vibe-talk/contract/package.json
!vibe-talk/contract/package-lock.json
!rs/
# The Rust-only validation image also builds from the repository root.
!rs/**
!validation/
!validation/rust-only/**
**/target/
**/.agent-utils-snapshots/
**/.agent-utils-locks/
**/node_modules/
**/.git/
**/.env
**/*.private.json
**/*.local.toml
**/*.toml.local
**/vibe-talk.toml
